{{fbdoc item="title" value="__FB_PIC__"}}----
Intrinsic define (macro value) set by the compiler

{{fbdoc item="syntax"}}##
	""__FB_PIC__""
##
{{fbdoc item="desc"}}
	Returns non-zero (-1) when position-independent code is active, or zero (0) otherwise. The compiler may enable this mode implicitly when required by the target or output type, as well as when [[CompilerOptpic|-pic]] is used.

{{fbdoc item="ver"}}
	- Since fbc 1.20.4

{{fbdoc item="see"}}
	- [[CompilerOptpic|Compiler Option: -pic]]

